(`gsub(/ ; /, " \\; ", cmd)`) collapses the escape on this machine's awk
(both /usr/bin/awk and nanobrew's gawk warn "escape sequence `\;' treated as
plain `;'" and drop the backslash), which the byte-exact golden cannot carry.

